---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="BhaktiMedia.in — Privacy Policy.">
<div class="container-x px-4 pb-20 pt-32 sm:px-6">
  <header class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Privacy <span class="text-gradient">Policy</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-2 font-dev text-sm text-golden/80">॥ गोपनीयता नीतिः ॥</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-sandal-deep/60 dark:text-cream/50">Last updated: 23 September 2026</p>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sandal-deep/80 dark:text-cream/75">
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">BhaktiMedia ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect, why we collect it, and how we protect it — in line with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">2. What We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li><b>Account data:</b> Name, email, phone, city, pincode (for invoicing & delivery)</li>
        <li><b>Payment data:</b> Processed by Razorpay — we never see or store your card/UPI details</li>
        <li><b>Studio uploads:</b> Photos you upload for poster generation (stored temporarily, auto-deleted after processing)</li>
        <li><b>Usage data:</b> Pages visited, creations made, session duration (for improving the service)</li>
        <li><b>Newsletter:</b> Email only, if you explicitly subscribe</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li>To run your account and deliver creations</li>
        <li>To process payments and generate GST invoices</li>
        <li>To send transactional emails (welcome, invoice, password reset)</li>
        <li>To send our monthly newsletter (only if subscribed)</li>
        <li>To improve AI prompts, templates, and site performance</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3"><b>We do NOT sell, rent, or share your personal data with marketers or data brokers.</b></p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">We use trusted partners who also protect your data:</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li><b>Razorpay</b> — payment processing</li>
        <li><b>Supabase</b> — authentication and database (EU/India hosted)</li>
        <li><b>Cloudflare</b> — hosting, CDN, DDoS protection</li>
        <li><b>OpenAI / Stability AI</b> — AI generation (prompts and photos sent for processing; they do not train on business API data)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">We use only essential cookies (login session, theme preference) and basic anonymous analytics. No third-party tracking ads, ever.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">6. Data Security</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Your data is encrypted in transit (HTTPS) and at rest. Access is limited to the BhaktiMedia team on a need-to-know basis. Uploaded photos are auto-deleted from our servers within 7 days unless saved to your creations.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">7. Your Rights (DPDP Act)</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6">
        <li><b>Right to access:</b> Ask us for a copy of your data</li>
        <li><b>Right to correction:</b> Update incorrect details from your dashboard</li>
        <li><b>Right to erasure:</b> Delete your account and all associated data anytime</li>
        <li><b>Right to withdraw consent:</b> Unsubscribe from newsletter, revoke data use</li>
        <li><b>Right to grievance redressal:</b> Contact our grievance officer below</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">8. Children</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Our service is intended for users aged 18+. We do not knowingly collect data from minors. If you believe a minor has provided us data, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">Updates will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date. Material changes will be communicated via email.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-sandal-deep dark:text-cream">10. Contact & Grievance Officer</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">For any privacy concern: <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-saffron hover:underline">Contact us</a>. Our grievance officer will respond within 30 days as per DPDP Act requirements.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>